k box' performance of systems they cannot fundamentally understand. My proposal replaces this speculative betting with empirical, verifiable standards. By focusing on technical, provable safety metrics rather than post-hoc legal remedies, we can prevent the deployment of misaligned systems before they pose a systemic threat, rather than merely litigating their consequences after the damage is done.",
